# Root .env.example is a pointer only. The API reads apps/api/.env and the
# mobile app reads apps/mobile/.env — copy the .env.example next to each:
#
#   cp apps/api/.env.example    apps/api/.env
#   cp apps/mobile/.env.example apps/mobile/.env
#
# Stack, for orientation (the real list with comments lives in those files):
#   OpenAI      — LLM (gpt-5.6-terra for Bobo, gpt-4o-mini for classifiers),
#                 STT fallback, TTS fallback
#   Deepgram    — primary STT (Nova-3, strict single-language)
#   ElevenLabs  — primary TTS (Bobo's voice)
#   Neon        — Postgres
#   Resend      — transactional email (reset codes, crisis alerts)
#   RevenueCat  — subscriptions
#   Sentry      — errors (optional)
#
# There is no Anthropic, Gemini or Redis in this codebase.
